---
const {kind}=Astro.props;
const pipeline=['Writing','Voices','Storyboard','Layout','Animation','Ink / paint','Camera','Editing'];
---
<aside class="production-diagram">
<p class="diagram-kicker">Original PointCast schematic</p>
{kind==='layers'&&<><h3>Change one layer. Keep the others.</h3><svg viewBox="0 0 720 300" role="img" aria-label="Four separate drawing layers: background, body, head and mouth. Each can be held or changed independently."><g fill="#f7ebd4" stroke="#705042" stroke-width="2"><rect x="20" y="30" width="150" height="200"/><rect x="195" y="30" width="150" height="200"/><rect x="370" y="30" width="150" height="200"/><rect x="545" y="30" width="150" height="200"/></g><path d="M30 160h130M30 160l50-65 50 65" stroke="#705042" fill="none" stroke-width="4"/><rect x="240" y="105" width="60" height="90" rx="10" fill="#527981"/><circle cx="445" cy="120" r="45" fill="#d8a36c"/><circle cx="430" cy="105" r="4"/><circle cx="460" cy="105" r="4"/><path d="M580 115h75M595 115q22 50 45 0" fill="#705042" stroke="#705042" stroke-width="3"/><g fill="#28221d" font-size="17" font-family="sans-serif" text-anchor="middle"><text x="95" y="265">Background</text><text x="270" y="265">Body</text><text x="445" y="265">Head</text><text x="620" y="265">Mouth</text></g></svg><p>Background, body, head and mouth are separate conceptual layers. The geometric figure is newly drawn for this explanation; it is not a Hanna-Barbera character or production cel.</p></>}
{kind==='frames'&&<><h3>A held body can carry a changing thought.</h3><svg viewBox="0 0 840 180" role="img" aria-label="Twelve fictional drawing positions share the same geometric head and body. Mouth shapes change among a line, an open mouth and a smile.">{Array.from({length:12},(_,i)=><g transform={`translate(${i*70},0)`}><rect x="3" y="8" width="64" height="150" fill="#f7ebd4" stroke="#705042"/><rect x="22" y="90" width="26" height="40" rx="3" fill="#527981"/><circle cx="35" cy="55" r="23" fill="#d8a36c"/><circle cx="27" cy="48" r="2"/><circle cx="43" cy="48" r="2"/>{i%3===0?<path d="M25 62h20" stroke="#705042" stroke-width="2"/>:i%3===1?<ellipse cx="35" cy="64" rx="6" ry="8" fill="#705042"/>:<path d="M25 61q10 14 20 0" stroke="#705042" stroke-width="2" fill="none"/>}<text x="35" y="149" text-anchor="middle" font-size="12">{i+1}</text></g>)}</svg><p>Twelve invented positions illustrate selective change. This is not a measured frame count, timing specification or reconstruction of any show.</p></>}
{kind==='pipeline'&&<><h3>Many jobs make one short film.</h3><svg viewBox="0 0 800 260" role="img" aria-label="Conceptual production pipeline: writing, voices, storyboard, layout, animation, ink and paint, camera, editing.">{pipeline.map((label,i)=><g transform={`translate(${(i%4)*200},${Math.floor(i/4)*125})`}><rect x="8" y="15" width="180" height="90" rx="4" fill="#f7ebd4" stroke="#705042" stroke-width="2"/><text x="98" y="52" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="15" fill="#705042">Stage {i+1}</text><text x="98" y="80" text-anchor="middle" font-family="sans-serif" font-size="19" fill="#28221d">{label}</text></g>)}</svg><ol>{pipeline.map(p=><li>{p}</li>)}</ol><p>A conceptual job map, not a universal schedule. Work can overlap, return for revision or use different processes. The archive photograph of Carl Urbano provides an actual workplace counterpart.</p></>}
{kind==='homes'&&<><h3>Partnership, company and library are different stages.</h3><svg viewBox="0 0 840 200" role="img" aria-label="Three distinct historical stages: Hanna and Barbera meet at MGM in 1937; independent company forms in 1957; Cartoon Network launches in 1992.">{[['1937','MGM partnership'],['1957','Independent company'],['1992','Cartoon Network']].map((pair,i)=><g transform={`translate(${i*280},0)`}><rect x="12" y="25" width="250" height="125" fill="#f7ebd4" stroke="#705042" stroke-width="2"/><text x="137" y="78" text-anchor="middle" font-size="30" font-family="sans-serif" fill="#705042">{pair[0]}</text><text x="137" y="113" text-anchor="middle" font-size="17" font-family="sans-serif" fill="#28221d">{pair[1]}</text></g>)}</svg><p>Article dates describe organizational stages. The accompanying building photographs were taken in 2007; they do not show the buildings at these event dates or establish continuous occupancy.</p></>}
</aside>
<style>
.production-diagram{margin-block:2rem;border-block:2px solid #b8aea0;padding-block:1.4rem}.production-diagram svg{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}.diagram-kicker{font-family:monospace;text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.07em;font-size:.8rem;color:#705042}.production-diagram p{font-size:.95rem;line-height:1.6}.production-diagram ol{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:.4rem;padding-left:1.5rem}@media(max-width:720px){.production-diagram ol{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr)}}
</style>
